        "zx_minifaq": {
          "type": "custom_liquid",
          "settings": {
            "custom_liquid": "<div style=\"margin:10px 0 0;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif\">\n<details style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(43,52,46,.12)\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:13px 2px;font:500 13.5px/1.4 'Inter',sans-serif;color:#36423C\">Does it hurt?<span style=\"color:#C0683F;font-size:16px;line-height:1\">+</span></summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 2px 14px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:#5A645E\">The first minute feels intensely prickly &mdash; then it melts into a warm, heavy calm. Sensitive? Start over a thin shirt. Most people are hooked by night three.</p></details>\n<details style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(43,52,46,.12)\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:13px 2px;font:500 13.5px/1.4 'Inter',sans-serif;color:#36423C\">When will I get it?<span style=\"color:#C0683F;font-size:16px;line-height:1\">+</span></summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 2px 14px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:#5A645E\">Ships within 1&ndash;2 business days, delivered in 3&ndash;7 across the U.S. &mdash; free. You get a tracking link by email, and you can follow your package on our <a href=\"/pages/track-your-order\" style=\"color:#36423C\">Track Your Order</a> page.</p></details>\n<details style=\"border-top:1px solid rgba(43,52,46,.12);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(43,52,46,.12)\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer;list-style:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:13px 2px;font:500 13.5px/1.4 'Inter',sans-serif;color:#36423C\">What if it's not for me?<span style=\"color:#C0683F;font-size:16px;line-height:1\">+</span></summary><p style=\"margin:0;padding:0 2px 14px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:#5A645E\">Sleep on it for up to 60 nights. If it hasn't earned its place in your evenings, email us &mdash; full refund, and the return label is on us.</p></details>\n</div>\n<style>#shopify-section-{{ section.id }} details summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}</style>"
